{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>ויחנטו</b> Twice in the parashah: ויחנטו את ישראל and ויחנטו את יוסף, as stated in Ketubot: יספדוניה דדלה ידלוניה — because he embalmed his father, they embalmed him as well. ויישם בארון — so that he would be available to them when they depart from there."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 50, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:53.854829462Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}